    "https://www.chalmers.se/en/about-chalmers/work-with-us/assistant-professor-positions/new-space/": {
      "title": "Assistant Professor in New Space",
      "description": "Available position: Assistant Professor in New Space | Chalmers Go to content Login Intranet ( Opens in new tab ) Library ( Opens in new tab ) Svenska sv Search Menu Education Research Collaborate with us About Chalmers Current Departments Assistant professor positions Home About Chalmers Work with us Assistant professor positions New Space Available position: Assistant Professor in Entrepreneurship in New Space Image 1 of 1 Chalmers now seeks curious and creative individuals for tenure-track Assistant Professors. As an Assistant Professor in New Space at Chalmers, you can turn your scientific curiosity into ideas, your ideas into experiments, and your experiments into discoveries. Application closed The application for the seventh global recruitment round for Assistant Professors is now closed. Advancing innovation and entrepreneurship in the New Space economy Space activities are rapidly evolving as new actors, technologies and business models transform the global space sector. At Chalmers, we combine space-related research and technology development with perspectives from innovation, entrepreneurship and industry. Located in a growing space ecosystem and supported by strong research environments and the national facility Onsala Space Observatory, Chalmers contributes to the development of the emerging New Space economy and the creation of new space-enabled services for society. The position as Assistant Professor comes with a five-year tenure track position with a generous start-up package, relocation support and mentoring, and leadership training to further your development as research leader and teacher. The position will be primarily based at the department of Technology Management and Economics, but the research will span several departments including but not limited to: Computer Science and Engineering Environmental and Energy Sciences Mechanical Engineering Physics and Astronomy Linked research infrastructures and partners: Chalmers Ventures Onsala Space Observatory Space West Learn more about the offer Brief timeline, available positions and more information about the offer For questions about the process, please contact Recruitment systems support HR department, Chalmers operations support Contact rekr.stodet@chalmers.se For questions about the position, please contact To personal page Rüdiger Haas Områdesledare , Physics and Astronomy Contact rudiger.haas@chalmers.se +46 31 772 55 30 To personal page Updated 2 June 2026, 13:44 Published 12 December 2023, 17:10 Assistant professor positions Basic Science Batteries Energy Materials Science Mechanical Engineering Nanoscience New Space Production Transport Related content Reputation and ranking World in progress Research infrastructures Research areas Departments For questions about the process, please contact Recruitment systems support HR department, Chalmers operations support Contact rekr.stodet@chalmers.se For questions about the position, please contact To personal page Rüdiger Haas Områdesledare , Physics and Astronomy Contact rudiger.haas@chalmers.se +46 31 772 55 30 To personal page Contact Chalmers Phone +46-317721000 Mail address Chalmers University of Technology 412 96 Gothenburg E-mail and more contact information Organisation number 556479-5598 Education Education Your studies Our Master's degree programmes Student support Services and tools Canvas learning management system Safe at Chalmers Chalmers student union Shortcuts Shortcuts Work at Chalmers Press and media Whistleblowing at Chalmers Safety and emergency situations Supplier information Chalmers University of Technology Foundation About the website About the website Cookies Processing of personal data Accessibility statement Service Disruptions at Chalmers Contact Chalmers Phone +46-317721000 Mail address Chalmers University of Technology 412 96 Gothenburg E-mail and more contact information Organisation number 556479-5598 Social media Instagram ( Opens in new tab ) Tiktok ( 